lass=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4284549/003-19c2be196b.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4284549/003-19c2be196b.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"1136\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n利落的背影\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n不过……\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n全身被用力挠的时候\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4284549/005-14a5845bb6.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4284549/005-14a5845bb6.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"636\" height=\"661\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n尤其是用力挠腰部附近时……\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4284549/006-2af06f5e93.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4284549/006-2af06f5e93.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n用力挠的时候……\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4284549/007-d21f358fba.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4284549/007-d21f358fba.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n不知为何，背上的毛会竖起来！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4284549/008-15d366a2aa.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4284549/008-15d366a2aa.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"1136\"></a></figure>\n\n            竖起来！\n\n<br>\n\n\n当然\n生气的时候也会\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4284549/009-33894a5962.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4284549/009-33894a5962.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4284549/010-f7ed5b769e.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4284549/010-f7ed5b769e.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"504\" height=\"413\"></a></figure>\n\n竖起来！！\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n然后\n说到毛会竖起来……\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4284549/011-25352aac94.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4284549/011-25352aac94.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"358\" height=\"198\"></a></figure>使出招式时，背上的毛会竖起来！\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n使出招式时竖起的毛！\n\n<br>\n\n\n看到这个的时候\n我觉得这是个\n绝妙的点子！\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n点子的积累\n虽然很辛苦，但真的非常重要！\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n所以说\n增田决定\n\n<br>\n\n\n火斑喵！\n\n<br>\n\n\n就决定是你了！！\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n下回再见！</div>","markdown_ja":"<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br>\n\n\nみんな\nポケットモンスター サン・ムーンの\n最初の3匹\n冒険を共にする最初のポケモン\n決めた？？\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nマスダは\nなかなか決められないけど・・・\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4284549/001-e9032ede26.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4284549/001-e9032ede26.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1066\" height=\"800\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nくつろぎ中も</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">普段はシュッとしている背中</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4284549/002-f488be18aa.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4284549/002-f488be18aa.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"><